<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Booking Status Update</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f6f2; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b2a4a 0%, #2d4a7a 100%); padding: 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #c49a2d; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-family: Georgia, serif; }
    .body { padding: 40px; color: #1b2a4a; }
    .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; background: #c49a2d; color: #fff; }
    .footer { padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>✈ Starlings Hospitality</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Booking Update, {{firstName}}</h2>
      <p>Your booking <strong>#{{referenceNumber}}</strong> has been updated.</p>
      <p>New Status: <span class="status-badge">{{status}}</span></p>
      <p>If you have any questions about this update, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© 2024 Starlings Hospitality</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
